        {"zh": "滴答滴答，物资小偷来了！", "en": "Tic toc, supply thief!"},
        {"zh": "嘶嘶嘶嘶，我来了！", "en": "Sssss, here I come!"},
        {"zh": "滴答滴答，找到补给点！", "en": "Tic toc, found supplies!"},
        {"zh": "嘶嘶嘶嘶，物资充足！", "en": "Sssss, supplies plentiful!"},
